---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site.ts";
---
<Base title="About" description="Who runs the registry, how it is funded, and how to reach us.">
  <article class="prose" data-pagefind-body>
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>[Dave: one or two sentences on who you are and why you started keeping this list.]</p>
    <h2>Funding</h2>
    <p>Independent and unfunded. No company, foundation, or model vendor pays for this site or has a say in what it includes.</p>
    <h2>Conflicts</h2>
    <p>Every entry states the conflicts we found: who funded the study, whether the vendor ran it, whether an author works for the company. Where a number comes from a company's own dashboard, the entry says so. [Dave: add any personal holdings or affiliations a reader should know about.]</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Propose or dispute an entry through the <a href={`${SITE.repo}/issues/new/choose`}>public repository</a>. [Dave: add an email address if you want one here.] Occasional updates by <a href={SITE.newsletter}>newsletter</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
